Prism — vendored third-party dependency
=======================================

Files:   prism-core.js, prism-json.js
Package: prismjs@1.30.0 (https://github.com/PrismJS/prism)
License: MIT (reproduced below)

Why it is checked in
--------------------
The console is served straight out of the daemon jar and must work with no network access and no
build step. Only Prism's minified core and JSON grammar are committed; no other language bundles,
plugins, themes, or runtime dependencies are included.

Regenerating
------------
Download https://registry.npmjs.org/prismjs/-/prismjs-1.30.0.tgz and extract
package/components/prism-core.min.js as prism-core.js and
package/components/prism-json.min.js as prism-json.js.


